    <div class="box" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white;">
        <ul style="line-height:1.5;">
            <li><span class="hl-badge">HL</span> Translation strategy affects <strong>performance</strong>, <strong>portability</strong>, and <strong>error detection</strong>.</li>
            <li><strong>Interpreters</strong> execute as they translate (fast iteration, slower runtime).</li>
            <li><strong>Compilers</strong> translate ahead-of-time (fast runtime, platform-specific output).</li>
            <li><strong>Bytecode + VM</strong> trades speed for portability; <strong>JIT</strong> can recover performance.</li>
        </ul>
